  "description": "Ninjo turns Instagram and WhatsApp inboxes into a 24/7 sales channel: AI agents that answer DMs, qualify leads, follow up, and book calls or sales for creators and businesses. This connector lets Claude operate your Ninjo workspace end to end.\n\nWith it, Claude can:\n- Create and iterate agents: system prompts, SDK configuration, triggers (keywords, comments, ads, story replies), voice replies, and context documents\n- Wire the automation around each agent: custom properties, contact limits, follow-up workflows, and operator notifications\n- Analyze performance: real conversations, funnel metrics, agent insights, and diagnostics that return ranked defects with the exact fix\n- Test safely: generate synthetic conversations against an agent before going live\n- Manage content: knowledge documents, agent-sendable audio/image resources, WhatsApp templates, and Instagram profile/post data\n\nRequires a Ninjo account. Sign in with your Ninjo credentials via OAuth when connecting.",
